-- title

vidDeck

A wrapper around youtube that provides global hotkey
to control the video for macOS.

This is primarily a personal project to make it
easier to take notes on videos by using
hotkeys to control the video while still in
a notes app. 


-- h2

Commands

{{Option + Shift + S}} - start/stop

{{Option + Shift + A}} - rewind 

{{Option + Shift + E}} - fast forward

{{Option + Shift + Z}} - slow down

{{Option + Shift + C}} - speed up


